# Mul-gwisin (물귀신), the water ghost of Korean folklore that drags people
# under: soaked dress, plastered hair, always dripping. Rises out of a
# puddle (rise_0 -> rise_1 -> idle). Side view, faces right.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 24 40
@output ../characters/creature_water_ghost.png
@preview ../previews/creature_water_ghost_x4.png 4
@columns 5

